message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "D4 — Disclosed AI adoption by listed Brazilian firms (FY2023–2024)"
abstract: >-
  A firm-year dataset of disclosed AI adoption by 18 listed Brazilian firms across banking,
  retail/customer service, and agribusiness (FY2023–2024), coded against a fixed codebook,
  with the supporting evidence and a reproducible collection pipeline. Dataset D4 of the
  research paper "Equalizer or Divider?".
type: dataset
